* Every imputed setting/side/event has at least one cohort with treated ATC3-sharing products.
* Empty lists are skipped; no directory scan or fallback cohort list.
* Key: coh_<i/d>_l<0/3>_r<n/o>_s<n/o>_h<n/o>_<A/B>_<diss/not/still>.

